---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="訊息已成功送出"
  description="您的訊息已成功送交 iBridge Education。我們會查看內容並儘快回覆。"
  locale="zh-tw"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="success-page">
    <div class="decoration" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="circle circle-one"></span>
      <span class="circle circle-two"></span>
      <span class="line"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="success-card">
        <div class="success-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 64 64"
            role="presentation"
          >
            <circle
              cx="32"
              cy="32"
              r="29"
            />

            <path
              d="M19 33.5 28 42l17-20"
            />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <p class="eyebrow">
          訊息已送出
        </p>

        <h1>
          感謝您聯絡
          <span>iBridge Education。</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="lead">
          我們已收到您的訊息，並會在查看內容後儘快回覆。
          請保留您所提供的電子郵件，以便我們與您聯絡。
        </p>

        <div class="information-card">
          <h2>接下來會發生什麼？</h2>

          <ol>
            <li>
              <span>01</span>

              <div>
                <h3>確認訊息內容</h3>
                <p>
                  我們會查看您提交的姓名、電子郵件、
                  詢問主題及訊息內容。
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li>
              <span>02</span>

              <div>
                <h3>安排適當回覆</h3>
                <p>
                  我們會依課程設計、教師培訓、研究、
                  教育資源或合作需求安排回覆。
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li>
              <span>03</span>

              <div>
                <h3>透過電子郵件聯絡</h3>
                <p>
                  回覆將寄送至您在表單中提供的電子郵件地址。
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
          <a
            class="primary-button"
            href="/"
          >
            返回首頁
          </a>

          <a
            class="secondary-button"
            href="/resources/"
          >
            瀏覽教育資源
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="language-note">
          <span>English confirmation page</span>

          <a
            href="/en/thank-you/"
            hreflang="en"
          >
            View in English
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .success-page {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 78vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 110px 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 88% 12%,
        rgba(196, 138, 44, 0.14),
        transparent 28%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #f7f1e3 0%,
        #faf7f0 100%
      );
  }

  .container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: min(900px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .decoration {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .circle {
    position: absolute;
    border: 1px solid rgba(165, 28, 48, 0.14);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .circle-one {
    top: -250px;
    right: -120px;
    width: 520px;
    height: 520px;
  }

  .circle-two {
    bottom: -190px;
    left: -90px;
    width: 340px;
    height: 340px;
  }

  .line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 45%;
    right: -150px;
    width: 720px;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(49, 92, 107, 0.16);
    transform: rotate(-17deg);
  }

  .success-card {
    padding: 64px;
    border: 1px solid #e4d7c5;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: rgba(250, 247, 240, 0.96);
    box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(31, 41, 51, 0.1);
  }

  .success-icon {
    width: 74px;
    height: 74px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .success-icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .success-icon circle {
    fill: rgba(165, 28, 48, 0.08);
    stroke: #a51c30;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .success-icon path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #a51c30;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-width: 4;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #a51c30;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.17em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #1f2933;
    font-family:
      "Helvetica Neue",
      Helvetica,
      Arial,
      "PingFang TC",
      sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  h1 span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: #a51c30;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 690px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: #52606d;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .information-card {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 34px;
    border: 1px solid #e4d7c5;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: #f7f1e3;
  }

  .information-card h2 {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
  }

  .information-card ol {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .information-card li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #e4d7c5;
  }

  .information-card li:first-child {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .information-card li:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .information-card li > span {
    padding-top: 4px;
    color: #a51c30;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .information-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .information-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #52606d;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 38px;
  }

  .actions a {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 50px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 25px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background 160ms ease,
      border-color 160ms ease,
      color 160ms ease,
      transform 160ms ease;
  }

  .actions a:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .primary-button {
    border: 1px solid #a51c30;
    background: #a51c30;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .primary-button:hover {
    border-color: #7b1422;
    background: #7b1422;
  }

  .secondary-button {
    border: 1px solid #315c6b;
    background: transparent;
    color: #315c6b;
  }

  .secondary-button:hover {
    background: #315c6b;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .language-note {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 14px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 25px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e4d7c5;
    color: #52606d;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .language-note a {
    color: #315c6b;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .success-page {
      padding: 76px 0;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(100% - 30px, 900px);
    }

    .success-card {
      padding: 38px 25px;
      border-radius: 22px;
    }

    .information-card {
      padding: 25px;
    }

    .information-card li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .actions {
      align-items: stretch;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .actions a {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>